 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "rose",
   "title": "Why config comes first",
   "items": [
    ".factory.yml is read from the default branch, so a PR cannot add itself to allowed_users",
    "The workflow input FACTORY_ALLOWED_USERS overrides it as a hard gate"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "amber",
   "title": "Failure handling",
   "items": [
    "Any error after auth (fork PR, setup failure, unknown harness, git error) posts a failure reply with the run link",
    "No changes: no push and no PR; the reply says so",
    "A re-run of the same issue reuses the factory/<n>-<slug> branch and its PR"
   ]
  }
 ]
